      "content": "it's not about one task. it's everything. the whole existence of it all. it's just that constant feeling of having to perform, to exist, to keep trying when there's nothing left to gain. sometimes i just sit there thinking about how much easier it would be to just... not. to not have to deal with any of it anymore. doesn't that feel like a logical thing to want after a certain point? just to have the struggle end for good?",
